    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG DOYLE are delighted to present this spacious, bright and light-filled, 3 bed roomed, corner apartment, which is ideally situated in this highly convenient location only minutes from all amenities to include shops, schools and the M7/N7 motorway. Commuting to Dublin City Centre is hassle free with the train station on your doorstep.\n\nWell-presented throughout, accommodation briefly comprises of; entrance hall, open plan kitchen/living/dining room, utility room, 2 x storage cupboards, large hot press, bathroom, 3 double bedrooms, en-suite and a balcony.\n\nOutside is two allocated parking spaces, but this fabulous apartment benefits from a very large private roof gardens with fantastic views of the surrounding country side, ideal for those lazy summer evenings."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - \nLarge hotpress, wood flooring, 2 x storage cupboards, utility with additional storage and plumbed for washing machine.\n\n- - \n\n\nKitchen/Living/Dining - 5.26m x 4.32m\nStunning bright room with wood flooring and access to balcony, ample room for living and dining. Kitchen area with tiled floor & splash back with integrated oven hob and extractor fan together with fridge freezer included in sale.\n\n- - \n\n\nMaster bedroom - 3.28m x 4.01m\nDouble room to the rear of the building with cloaks closet. A large fully tiled en-suite with razor light, tiled floor and shower unit.\n\n- - \n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.0m x 2.5m\nA large double room to the side\n\n- - \n\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.2m x 3.2m\nA double room with large window and built in wardrobe.\n\n- - \n\n\nRoof Garden - 6.5m x 6.5m\nFantastic addition to the property is this stunning L shaped garden terrace with spacious seating area and fully paved with fabulous views of the country side.\n\n- - \n\n\nDisclaimer : - \nThe above are issued by DNG Doyle Naas on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars which are issued for guidance purposes only and neither the form nor the agent holds themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. The purchaser is advised to make their own arrangements to satisfy themselves with measurements, details and contents include conditions.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Well-presented throughout</li><li> Private spacious roof garden</li><li> Balcony</li><li> Open plan kitchen/living/dining room</li><li> Utility room</li><li> 2 x Storage closet</li><li> Large Hot-press</li><li> 2 Allocated parking</li><li> Electric storage heating</li><li> Double-glazing</li><li> Convenient location - within walking distance of all amenities</li><li> Within easy commuting distance of Dublin via road or rail - the Arrow train station is on the doorstep</ul>"
      },
